{
  "bodyHash": "t4dnufcTALc=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1450/534/sharex_lgdglbsh9i-ezgif.gif\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">這個模組在你的世界中加入了可馴服的草原犬鼠。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">你可以在平原和草甸生態域找到牠們。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">（在 Forge 中，你可以透過編輯 data -&gt; biome tags 和 biome modifier 資料夾中的 JSON 檔案，</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">或使用資源包來更改此設定及其他生成設定；</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">而在 Fabric 中則有對應的設定檔。）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">因為牠們是雜食性的，你可以用任何食物物品馴服牠們。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">如果已馴服，當附近有生物鎖定主人時，牠會發出「吠叫」聲。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">如果未馴服，則在受到攻擊時會驚慌，並避開附近的生物。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此外，每 5 到 10 分鐘，當牠在地面上時，有機會挖掘出一個物品。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">該物品是從名為 random_item.json 的 JSON 物品標籤中選取的（你也可以透過編輯模組 JAR 檔案中的 data -&gt; item tags 資料夾中的 JSON 檔案，</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">或使用資源包來設定）。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">牠們有 3 種行為模式：</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- 遊蕩（四處走動；若已馴服，則會在設定為遊蕩模式的那個方塊周圍走動）</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- 休息（待在原地）</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- 跟隨（跟隨主人）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">在生物生成前，系統會檢查該位置周圍是否已有同類型生物。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">如果有的話，則會計算其數量。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">在設定中，你也可以更改檢查範圍的半徑以及最大數量。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">如果該區域內的生物數量超過最大值，則不會生成新的生物。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此選項是為了防止過度生成。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">模組目前支援的版本：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Forge&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26.x | 1.21.x | 1.20.6 | 1.20.4 | 1.20.1 | 1.19.4 | 1.19.2 | 1.18.2</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Neoforge 26.x | 1.21.x | 1.20.6 | 1.20.4 </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.x | 1.21.x | 1.20.6 | 1.20.4 | 1.20.1 | 1.19.4</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>從版本 1.0.2 開始，牠們是晝行性的（未馴服時會在夜間睡覺）。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>如果你需要在 CurseForge 上取得其他版本的模組，請發送私人訊息給我。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>在 X（Twitter）上追蹤我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組需要安裝 AquariusLibs</span></strong></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1502/308/java_gbhoyhqwiu-ezgif.gif\"></span></strong></span></span></p>",
